OL,3,GNEWSAValentine card from Amy Winehouse
OL,4,Ais sold for #5k
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Valentine's Day card sent by Amy
OL,7,FWinehouse to her jailed husband has
OL,8,Fbeen auctioned for nearly #5,000 in
OL,9,FSurrey, 15 years after her death.
OL,11,FThe late singer posted the love note to
OL,12,FBlake Fielder-Civil after he ended up
OL,13,Fbehind bars in 2008 for assault and
OL,14,Fperverting the course of justice.
OL,16,FWinehouse mailed the card from an
OL,17,Fisland in the Caribbean where she had
OL,18,Fbeen holidaying with another man - the
OL,19,FBack to Black star having already filed
OL,20,Ffor divorce from Fielder-Civil, with
OL,21,Fwhom she had tied the knot in May 2007.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
