OL,3,GNEWSAValentine card from Amy Winehouse
OL,4,Ais sold for #5k
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndrew Ewbank, of Ewbank's auctioneers
OL,7,Fin Woking said the item was a
OL,8,F"fascinating insight" into Winehouse's
OL,9,Flife and called her "one of the
OL,10,Fgreatest artists of modern times".
